# Build context for annotation_server/Dockerfile. The collector needs its own
# package plus the sample CSVs; nothing else. Without this file `fly deploy`
# would upload the 128 MB sentence pool and both virtualenvs on every deploy.
*
!annotation_server/
!DATA/gold_standard/*.csv
# Never ship credentials or annotator work, even though the sample CSVs come
# from the same tree.
api_keys/
**/api_keys.json
DATA/gold_standard/annotations/
